  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Xét hai mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có điểm chung là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường trung bình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.)<br>Khi đó giao tuyến của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là đường thẳng qua <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> và song song với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, đường thẳng này cắt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> lần lượt tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>E</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>F</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của mỗi đường.<br>Theo tính chất của đường trung bình thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>,<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mặt khác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều cạnh bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> nên các tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều cạnh bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> và có cùng diện tích <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó diện tích cần tìm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (đvdt).</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/9255edade79a93211d46e2fc832913c5fa93e1fc0cac0a5cf791de556182ede9.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
